Submersible Drainage Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat13\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump\" id=\"6872872\">Sewage Submersible Pump</a><ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/ss-submersible-sewage-pump-with-float-switch\" id=\"6872928\">SS Submersible Sewage Pump with Float Switch</a></li>\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/submersible-sewage-pump-with-grinder\" id=\"6872929\">Submersible Sewage Pump with Grinder</a></li>\n</ul></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat14\"><a href=\"/self-suction-screw-pump\" id=\"6872880\">Self Suction Screw Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat15\"><a href=\"/submersible-solar-pump\" id=\"7719400\">Submersible Solar Pump</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"con_title\">Contact Us</div>\n<div class=\"contact_box\"><p>JD Frontier</p><p>ADD: City Saddar Road, Rawalpindi, Pakistan</p><p>TEL: <a href=\"tel:+92515553023\">051-5553023</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pro_right\">\n<div class=\"pror_wrap\">\n<div class=\"pror_detail\">\n<div class=\"fl\"><div class=\"singglepic\"><img alt=\"Big Capacity Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/big-flow-submersible-pump51185709504.jpg\"/></div><link href=\"/images/spic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/></div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Big Capacity Submersible Pump</h1>\n<p>The big capacity submersible pumps we sell are famous for their big flow and high efficiency, which of course are the most important thing that customers pay attention to. Our products have been tested in the market for many years,it with high stability and quality.Only with quality pumps like ours, could people enjoy a convenient and comfortable life. We tend to build a mutually beneficial relationship with you.</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"67486364\"/></p><p><strong>big capacity submersible pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241153022995958.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>The big flow submersible pumps we sell are famous for their big flow and high efficiency, which of course are the most important thing that customers pay attention to. Only with quality pumps like ours, could people enjoy a convenient and comfortable life. We tend to build a mutually beneficial relationship with you.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter(specification)</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Model Number</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">6SRm36</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Structure</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Multistage Pump</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power Type</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Brand</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">JIADI</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Head</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">256m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Q Max.</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">55 m3/h</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">4-22kW/ 5.5-30HP</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor:</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Oil filled, 100% Copper Wire</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Item Shape</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Round</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Diameter</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">143 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Pump Length</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1277-2949 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Outlet Connection Size</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">3  inches</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Voltage</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">220-240/380-415 volts ~ 50Hz</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Highest temperature of  water</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Warranty Description</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">One year manufacturer's warranty from the purchase date for parts and labor.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241155013942952.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/admin.seo.com.cn/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241152583065465.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3.Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Plastic Impeller</p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241157039275863.jpg\"/></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\">·High durable plastic, long-time using, <br/>sand resistant<br/>·Bearing high flow rate and pressure</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Mechanical Seal<br/><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241157125054658.jpg\"/> <br/>·No oil-leakage keep the well safe<br/>·Water and sand proof keep the motor safe</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Rotor Shaft<br/><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241157243619959.jpg\"/> <br/>·Super smooth shaft surface(mirror finish), reduceenergy loss and mechanical seal abrasion</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>mpeller Intermediate Supporter<br/><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241157368957548.jpg\"/> <br/>·PC material, anti-high-temperature</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Product Application</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241158205291326.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image019(001).jpg\"/></p><p>This clean water submersible pump is the most extensively used pump suitable for arable land irrigation, mine water drainage, as well as for flood control campaign. It is compact in construction, tight in sealing quality, high efficiency in energy conservation, and long durability for use as well. It is suitable for river, lake and well, etc.  </p><p><strong>5. Company Information</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241158231522229.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image021(001).jpg\"/></p><p>At the very beginning, we were just a small operation, but now millions of JIADI pumps are operating and transporting water for people from all over the world. With more and more people purchasing pumps from us, JIADI brand has already become one of the leading submersible pump brands in many countries and regions. We are always ready to serve our customers.</p><p>Size: 2\", 2.5\", 3\", 3.5\", 4\", 5\", and 6\"</p><p>Voltage: 220V/380V/50Hz</p><p>110V/220V/380V/60Hz</p><p>Power: 0.18kW - 22kW</p><p>Capacity: 0.5m3/h – 60m3/h</p><p>Series: QJ, SR, SP, SK, QGDA, EGDA, EGD, QG, QDX, VSM</p><p>Fluid: clean water, dirty water and thick liquid.</p><p><strong>6. Why Choose Us</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image023(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241159291199398.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong>7. Product Certification</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240909571261840.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO14001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">OHSAS18001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">CE</td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240910014421578.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">GS</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO9001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">RoHS</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p>We take pride in those certificates we have got through those years’ hard work, which are the strongest evidence that our company attach great importance to the quality of our products. </p><p><strong>8. Exhibition Show</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241247315627672.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image029(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>9. Packing and Delivery</strong></p><p><strong>Standard export packing for deep well pump : </strong></p><p>1) 1 pc in box carton packing </p><p>2) Wooden box or carton box packing</p><p><strong>Port:</strong></p><p>NINGBO / SHANGHAI</p><p><strong>Lead Time :</strong></p><p>3-5 weeks</p><p><strong>Supply Capability: </strong></p><p>100,000 Pieces per Month</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241247357688766.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image031(001).jpg\"/><